WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.582
Generation is a loop.

00:00:01.582 --> 00:00:08.967
Start with “The user submitted the request.” The model predicts a token, perhaps “today,” and appends it.

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:14.192
The new sequence becomes the input for the next prediction.

00:00:14.192 --> 00:00:20.682
The next selected token might be “before,” and then another token such as “noon.”

00:00:20.682 --> 00:00:27.606
This is autoregressive generation. Every token changes the context for the token that comes after it.
